-- Two signatures of the same binary operator (overloaded at different types)
-- that declare disagreeing fixities: the chain use site reports the conflict
-- rather than silently picking one.

@infixl 6
GIVEN p IS A NUMBER
      q IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
p CLASHOP q MEANS p + q

@infixr 7
GIVEN p IS A STRING
      q IS A STRING
GIVETH A STRING
p CLASHOP q MEANS q

#EVAL CLASHOP CLASHOP 1 2 CLASHOP 3
